# A channel handle must not outlive the scope that frees it. Sibling of
# affine_task_container.ty; the second `# expect:` pins that it names its line.
# expect: a channel handle cannot be stored in a container or aggregate -- pass it as an argument instead
# expect: affine_chan_container.ty:7: error:
fn main():
    ch := channel(int, 4)
    chs := [ch, ch]
    println(str(len(chs)))
